{"title":"Career Roadmap — Performance Marketer","role":"Performance Marketer","summary":"Role overview:\nA Performance Marketer uses paid advertising, analytics, experimentation and conversion optimisation to generate measurable business outcomes such as leads, sales, app installs, subscriptions or revenue. The role combines marketing strategy + advertising platforms + data analysis + experimentation.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Digital Marketing / Social Media Analytics"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Paid-media portfolio + internship"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Multi-channel performance expertise"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Growth strategy + team leadership"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"AI-driven growth + business leadership"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career-route check"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Digital Marketing / Social Media Analytics","Digital Marketing Internship","Performance Marketing Trainee/Executive","Performance Marketer","Senior Performance Marketer","Growth/Acquisition Manager","Head of Performance/Growth"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong and direct alignment with the degree."},{"type":"note","label":"Timeline assumption","text":"The roadmap assumes the student starts UG in 2026. B.Sc duration may be 3 or 4 years depending on the university."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Marketing fundamentals"},{"text":"College + structured courses"},{"text":"Marketing case studies"},{"text":"Marketing foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Social media + content analytics"},{"text":"Platform resources"},{"text":"Social analytics report"},{"text":"Digital awareness"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Paid advertising fundamentals"},{"text":"Google/Meta learning"},{"text":"Campaign simulation"},{"text":"Advertising"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Analytics + tracking"},{"text":"GA4, Tag Manager, Excel"},{"text":"Tracking implementation"},{"text":"Measurement"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Conversion optimisation"},{"text":"CRO/A-B testing"},{"text":"Landing-page experiment"},{"text":"Growth"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Performance marketing internship"},{"text":"Agency/startup"},{"text":"Campaign portfolio"},{"text":"Industry readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced acquisition"},{"text":"Search/social/programmatic"},{"text":"Multi-channel strategy"},{"text":"Strategic capability"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Portfolio + placements"},{"text":"Real campaign analysis"},{"text":"Performance case studies"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Marketing fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing funnel"},{"text":"Customer journey"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Target audience"},{"text":"Positioning"},{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"Customer personas"},{"text":"Acquisition"},{"text":"Activation"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Referral"},{"text":"Revenue"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the difference between:"},{"type":"h","text":"Brand marketing → creates awareness and preference"},{"type":"h","text":"Performance marketing → optimises measurable business outcomes"},{"type":"p","text":"Modern marketers often need both."}]},{"heading":"Paid advertising","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become comfortable with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Search advertising"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Ads"},{"text":"Search campaigns"},{"text":"Keywords"},{"text":"Match types"},{"text":"Negative keywords"},{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"Ad copy"},{"text":"Quality Score"},{"text":"Bidding"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Google Ads","url":"https://ads.google.com/"},{"type":"h","text":"Social advertising"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Meta Ads"},{"text":"Instagram advertising"},{"text":"LinkedIn Ads"},{"text":"YouTube advertising"},{"text":"TikTok advertising where available/appropriate"},{"text":"Audience targeting"},{"text":"Custom audiences"},{"text":"Lookalike/similar audiences"},{"text":"Retargeting"},{"text":"Creative testing"},{"text":"Campaign objectives"},{"text":"Budget allocation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Meta for Business","url":"https://www.facebook.com/business/"}]},{"heading":"Performance metrics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"table","header":["Metric","Meaning"],"rows":[[{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Number of times an ad is displayed"}],[{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Unique users exposed"}],[{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"Click-through rate"}],[{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"Cost per click"}],[{"text":"CPM"},{"text":"Cost per thousand impressions"}],[{"text":"CVR"},{"text":"Conversion rate"}],[{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"Cost per acquisition"}],[{"text":"CPL"},{"text":"Cost per lead"}],[{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"Customer acquisition cost"}],[{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"Return on ad spend"}],[{"text":"LTV"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"}],[{"text":"AOV"},{"text":"Average order value"}],[{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Average ad exposure per user"}],[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Revenue attributed to marketing"}],[{"text":"Contribution margin"},{"text":"Profit contribution after relevant costs"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not optimise campaigns based on CTR alone."},{"type":"p","text":"A campaign with lower CTR can sometimes produce better customers and higher revenue."}]},{"heading":"Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Analytics 4"},{"text":"Google Search Console"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SQL basics"},{"text":"Power BI/Tableau basics"},{"text":"Python/pandas basics"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Attribution"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Marketing dashboards"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Google Analytics","url":"https://analytics.google.com/"}]},{"heading":"Tracking and attribution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important areas for a serious performance marketer."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UTM parameters"},{"text":"Conversion events"},{"text":"Pixels/tags"},{"text":"Google Tag Manager"},{"text":"GA4 events"},{"text":"Server-side tracking concepts"},{"text":"Attribution models"},{"text":"First-click attribution"},{"text":"Last-click attribution"},{"text":"Data-driven attribution"},{"text":"Incrementality"},{"text":"Marketing-mix concepts"},{"text":"Cross-device measurement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"h","text":"A conversion being reported by a platform"},{"type":"p","text":"and"},{"type":"p","text":"a genuinely incremental conversion caused by the marketing activity."}]},{"heading":"Conversion Rate Optimisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Landing-page optimisation"},{"text":"CTA optimisation"},{"text":"Form optimisation"},{"text":"Checkout optimisation"},{"text":"Page speed"},{"text":"User experience"},{"text":"Copy testing"},{"text":"A/B testing"},{"text":"Multivariate testing concepts"},{"text":"Heatmaps"},{"text":"Session recordings"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools/concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Optimize concepts/history"},{"text":"Microsoft Clarity"},{"text":"Hotjar"},{"text":"VWO"},{"text":"Optimizely"},{"text":"GA4"}]}]},{"heading":"Experimentation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A professional performance marketer should think experimentally."},{"type":"p","text":"Basic structure:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hypothesis","Audience","Variable","Experiment","Measurement","Statistical interpretation","Decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"note","label":"Hypothesis","text":"A shorter registration form will improve lead conversion without materially reducing lead quality."},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Conversion rate","CPL","qualified-lead rate","downstream revenue"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"not merely clicks."}]},{"heading":"Creative strategy","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Performance marketing is increasingly creative-led."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ad copy"},{"text":"Headlines"},{"text":"Hooks"},{"text":"Short-form video"},{"text":"Static creatives"},{"text":"UGC concepts"},{"text":"Product demonstrations"},{"text":"Testimonials"},{"text":"Problem-solution creative"},{"text":"Offer communication"},{"text":"Creative testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Creative","Attention","Message","Click","Landing page","Conversion"]}]},{"heading":"Landing pages","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"Headline hierarchy"},{"text":"Social proof"},{"text":"Benefits"},{"text":"Trust signals"},{"text":"CTA"},{"text":"Forms"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Objection handling"},{"text":"Mobile UX"},{"text":"Page speed"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A performance marketer should be able to audit a landing page and identify where users may be dropping out."}]},{"heading":"Budget and business skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Campaign budgeting"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"LTV"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"Contribution margin"},{"text":"Break-even CAC"},{"text":"ROAS targets"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Budget allocation"},{"text":"P&L fundamentals"},{"text":"Marketing ROI"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"If:"},{"type":"h","text":"Average contribution per customer = ₹2,000"},{"type":"p","text":"and"},{"type":"h","text":"CAC = ₹600"},{"type":"p","text":"the acquisition may be economically attractive, but the final decision also depends on retention, refunds, payment costs and other business expenses."}]},{"heading":"CRM and lifecycle marketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Email marketing"},{"text":"WhatsApp marketing"},{"text":"Push notifications"},{"text":"Lead nurturing"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Retargeting"},{"text":"Marketing automation"},{"text":"Lead scoring"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Retention campaigns"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools to explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HubSpot"},{"text":"Salesforce"},{"text":"Mailchimp"},{"text":"Brevo"},{"text":"Customer.io"},{"text":"CleverTap"}]}]},{"heading":"AI for performance marketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop practical AI skills for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ad-copy ideation"},{"text":"Creative variations"},{"text":"Audience research"},{"text":"Keyword clustering"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Search-query analysis"},{"text":"Campaign summarisation"},{"text":"Automated reporting"},{"text":"Anomaly detection"},{"text":"Forecasting"},{"text":"Customer segmentation"},{"text":"Personalisation"},{"text":"Marketing-data analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"But AI-generated output should be validated against actual campaign data and business economics."},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio projects"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for at least 6–8 measurable projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Google Ads simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a complete search campaign structure for a fictional business."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Meta campaign analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a campaign and identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Winning creatives"},{"text":"Audience performance"},{"text":"CPC"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"CPA"},{"text":"ROAS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Landing-page CRO"},{"type":"p","text":"Create two landing-page variants and define an A/B test."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Marketing dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI/Excel dashboard showing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Spend","Clicks","Leads","Customers","Revenue","ROAS"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Funnel analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Impression","Click","Landing page","Signup","Purchase"]},{"type":"p","text":"and identify the largest drop-off."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — Customer cohort analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Compare customer retention and revenue across acquisition cohorts."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 7 — E-commerce acquisition plan"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a ₹5 lakh hypothetical monthly advertising plan and allocate the budget across channels."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 8 — Final-year growth project"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a complete:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Acquisition","Conversion","Retention","Revenue"]},{"type":"p","text":"strategy for a real or simulated business."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Paid Search"},{"text":"Google Ads, keywords, CRO"},{"text":"Search campaigns"},{"text":"Search/Growth Manager"}],[{"text":"Paid Social"},{"text":"Meta/LinkedIn ads, creatives"},{"text":"Social campaigns"},{"text":"Paid Social Manager"}],[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"ROAS, CAC, LTV, CRO"},{"text":"Online stores"},{"text":"E-commerce Growth Manager"}],[{"text":"B2B Marketing"},{"text":"LinkedIn, lead generation, CRM"},{"text":"B2B campaigns"},{