ting → Growth Marketing"},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Marketing → Marketing Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Marketing → E-commerce Growth"},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Marketing → User Acquisition"},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Marketing → Demand Generation"},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Marketing → Marketing Strategy"},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Marketing → Agency/Consulting"},{"type":"h","text":"Performance Marketing → Founder/Marketing Agency Entrepreneur"},{"type":"h","text":"PhD / research routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible research directions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital marketing"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Marketing analytics"},{"text":"Advertising effectiveness"},{"text":"Social-media marketing"},{"text":"Marketing attribution"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Digital consumer psychology"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"AI in marketing"},{"text":"Marketing automation"},{"text":"Pricing and conversion"},{"text":"Personalisation"},{"text":"Influencer marketing"},{"text":"Marketing experimentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A research-oriented student can progress:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc","Master's","Research Assistant","PhD","Marketing Analytics/Research/Academia"]},{"type":"note","label":"2035–2046","text":"How this career evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Performance marketing is moving from simple ad buying toward full-funnel growth management."},{"type":"p","text":"Future professionals will increasingly combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Paid media","first-party data","experimentation","AI","customer analytics","business economics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"AI will automate parts of campaign creation, bidding, audience analysis, reporting and creative generation. The higher-value human skills will increasingly be:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strategy"},{"text":"Experiment design"},{"text":"Customer understanding"},{"text":"Incrementality analysis"},{"text":"Business judgement"},{"text":"Budget allocation"},{"text":"Creative direction"},{"text":"Data interpretation"},{"text":"Cross-functional leadership"}]},{"type":"p","text":"By the 2040s, the strongest professionals are likely to evolve from campaign operators into growth strategists and business leaders."}]}]}